WEBVTT

00:00.415 --> 00:02.290
Alerts. Tabs. Rumours.

00:02.290 --> 00:04.865
When a story breaks,
it's everywhere at once.

00:06.163 --> 00:07.888
So what actually happened?

00:08.575 --> 00:10.250
This is The Daily Loop.

00:11.254 --> 00:15.604
News from verified writers,
checked by an editor before it goes live.

00:16.807 --> 00:19.901
Every developing story gets its own timeline.

00:19.901 --> 00:23.726
Each update lands in order,
from the first report to right now.

00:25.309 --> 00:28.434
Key moments are marked,
so you can skip to what changed.

00:34.661 --> 00:36.936
Short on time? Swipe through Shorts.

00:37.593 --> 00:40.943
The whole story in seconds,
in the lift or over lunch.

00:46.550 --> 00:50.150
Switch topics in one tap,
and search any story by name.

00:50.814 --> 00:52.614
Comment, react and bookmark.

00:52.614 --> 00:54.039
It's free to join.

00:55.199 --> 00:57.374
The Daily Loop. Stay in the loop.
